# .env.local is the single source of truth

`_legacy_web/.env.local` is **auto-generated** from the root `.env.local`.

- Edit only the **root** `.env.local`.
- Run `./scripts/sync-web-env.sh` after saving to propagate changes to `_legacy_web/.env.local`.
  The git pre-commit hook runs this automatically whenever `_legacy_web/.env.local` is stale.
- Do **not** edit `_legacy_web/.env.local` directly — changes will be overwritten.
- `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` variables are Expo-only and are **not** copied; the two Supabase public vars are translated to `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` automatically.
